    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Code-driven Number Sequence Calculation: Enhancing the inductive Reasoning Abilities of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
