    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Expertise need not monopolize: Action-Specialized <span class="search-hit mathjax">Mixture</span> of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Experts</span> for Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action Learning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shen%2C+W">Weijie Shen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+Y">Yitian Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+Y">Yuhao Wu</a>, 
      
