    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        BRIEF-Pro: Universal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Context</span> Compression with Short-to-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Long</span> Synthesis for Fast and Accurate Multi-Hop Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
