        MMLongCite: A Benchmark for Evaluating Faithfulness of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Long</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Context</span> Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
